====== Oolite V1.0 ======

  * development friendly OEM module 
  * presumably made by a Shenzhen based manufacturer called Gainstrong.
  * Datasheet: [[http://img.ozdisan.com/ETicaret_Dosya%5C417331_5195021.pdf]]
  * based [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.qualcomm.ar71xx#ar9331|Qualcomm Atheros AR9331]] chipset, thus lot of general information overlaps with the Wiki pages of other [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.qualcomm.ar71xx#ar9331_based_devices|AR9331-based devices]]. 
  * OpenWrt pre-installed, source is available from [[https://github.com/ooioe]]. Currently (July 2014) this source won't build as-is. However, device support is available in 14.07 (Barrier Breaker)

