===== U-Boot Update =====
pepe2k's modded u-boot works on this device. Download a precompiled binary {{:media:oolite:v1:uboot_for_gs-oolite_v1_dev.bin.tar.gz|here}}  (unpack before using). Follow the upgrade instructions in [[https://github.com/pepe2k/u-boot_mod#using-uart-u-boot-console-and-tftp-server|pepe2k's README]]. This version of the bootloader has a functional httpd application that allows you to upload new firmware directly to the bootloader from your browser (similar functionality to other routers that have a function-by-number menu in the bootloader for flashing firmware).


